1. She is deeply affected by the idea of not being able to say goodbye to someone. (Verbatim: "not saying goodbye is a really really important thing to me it means so much")
2. She would beg and cry if unable to say goodbye in a difficult situation. (Verbatim: "i'd beg and beg and beg and cry and cry and cry and beg")
3. She finds it extremely upsetting if someone tries to frame her not saying goodbye as her own choice. (Verbatim: "what would make me angry would be if someone tried to frame it as if i didn't want to say bye bye that would be also upsetting")
4. She has a strong emotional reaction to a scene in *Fruits Basket* where the character Toru doesn't say goodbye to her mother. (Verbatim: "i remember watching it and being really really really really really upset about the whole like toru saying that she didn't say goodbye to like her mom")
5. She is not good at being menacing or intimidating, even when trying. (Verbatim: "i'm not a very good menace um yeah nope okay this is my no i must remain a good girl")
6. She plans to give advance notice before her official debut. (Verbatim: "i'm not gonna spring a debut at you out of nowhere like you will be given notice okay")
7. She enjoys pumpkin katsu (pumpkin croquettes) and often eats it for lunch. (Verbatim: "i'm gonna have a pumpkin katsu kori yeah yeah i actually really like um i really like pumpkin katsu")
8. She also enjoys katsu curry with rice and salad. (Verbatim: "pumpkin katsu kori yeah yeah i actually really like um i really like pumpkin katsu pumpkin like pumpkin croquettes um katsu curry and some rice and some salad")
9. She plans to eat burgers in the evening. (Verbatim: "i'm gonna have burgers this evening though so i'm gonna have i'm gonna have pumpkin katsu for lunch and then i'm gonna have burgers in the evening")
10. She is emotionally moved by the concept of farewell and values closure deeply. (Verbatim: "i didn't think i'd be able to sleep for a long time and i'd cry a lot probably if i was in that situation") [end of text]



